    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is from the rivers of time itself. The forms of these eidolons are innumerable and at times inscrutable, sometimes emotional echoes given form like a siktempora while others something utterly alien like a hound of Tindalos or ancient one. These bonds are liminal, as the eidolon often has a unique perspective of their summoner's timeline.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> Occult</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> aberration, eidolon, time</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> Dimension of Time</p><hr /><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> tentacle (bludgeoning), claws (slashing), jaws (piercing)</p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> <em>Con</em> +2, <em>Int</em> +1, <em>Wis</em> +1, <em>Cha</em> -1</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Occultism, Stealth</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> Aklo</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Initial (1st) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.EVLnP7NF10q6MJj3]{Time and Time Again}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span></p><p><strong>Symbiosis (7th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.dnYFDAiFKy1HWPmf]{Time Flicker Strike}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><p><strong>Transcendence (17th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.NJAPZsU45s0PdmHz]{Time Dilation}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><hr /><p>The summoner's half of this eidolon is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.summons-unleashed.Item.YZ9AcxFrb6NZ5xIE]{Time Eidolon} in the Summons Unleashed compendium.</p>"
    },
